  triage:description "qa-pr1182-r1 (msg 01M1QSQWFKBENPSW4ZP83SKMYS) at 199a3bfeb: RBQA-F003 (minor, pre-existing, not attributable to AW.3): .just/lint-config.toml's atm-http-runtime allowlist entry has no boundary_record_path, so drift in boundaries/atm-http-runtime/http-runtime.toml allowed_dependencies (missing atm-runtime etc.) goes mechanically unchecked. Fix: add the boundary_record_path and reconcile the allowed_dependencies list with the actual Cargo edges. CLOSURE (qa-pr1182-r2, quality-mgr): b41b1fcdb's .just/lint-config.toml atm-http-runtime entry now has boundary_record_path pointing at boundaries/atm-http-runtime/http-runtime.toml, and the two allowed_dependencies lists are reconciled. Independently confirmed by req-qa and arch-qa. Finding closed." ;
